	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="left" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Arcane Chorus </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases Arcane mitigation for all group members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Rousing Celebration </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Plays a celebratory melody for the troubadour&#39;s party. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Luck Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A very high damage stealth attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Bria&#39;s Entrancing Sonnet </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Charms a creature into following the bard. If it&#39;s instructed to do anything other than follow the bard the song breaks. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lorre&#39;s Snapping Sonnet </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Decreases enemy defense and depletes power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Aria of Excitement </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Augmentation that has a chance to grant all group members additional instant mental damage on a successful attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Sybil&#39;s Shuddering Sonnet </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Decreases enemy movement speed and slightly drains power when the snare dissipates. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Raxxyl&#39;s Energizing Harmony </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases all attributes and increases hate. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Alin&#39;s Soothing Serenade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Slowly lowers your hate with the encounter. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin/Brigand/Dirge<br />Ranger/Swashbuckler/Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Escape </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ports your group to zone in. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Fulgent Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A high damage mental attack that reduces enemy mental resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Eli&#39;s Thunderous Hymn </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Inflicts arcane damage on a single target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Dissenting Cantata </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A ranged attack that does mental damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Dirge</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Bria&#39;s Thrilling Ballad </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases power regeneration for the party. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Bria&#39;s Thrilling Ballad </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases Power Replenishment for the party. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Elises Ditty </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases agility, arcane resistance and has a chance to interrupt enemies on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Luda&#39;s Resonant Sonata </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases group attack speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Swindle Essence </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Drains power from the target, and returns a portion of this damage as power to the caster. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Alin&#39;s Melodic Refrain </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ranged mental damage effect to all enemies in an encounter. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Sandra&#39;s Deafening Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A quick attack the deals mental and power damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Quiron&#39;s Joyous Celebration </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases health regeneration of the party. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deafening Missle </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Requires a ranged weapon. Fires two shots at once that deal mental damage and stifle enemies. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">31 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Mala&#39;s Silent Hymn </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Allow&#39;s stealthed movement at an increased movement speed and briefly stops enemy attacks if the troubadour is hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">31 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Minstrel&#39;s Fortune </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the offense skills and wisdom of all group members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Kian&#39;s Destructive Anthem </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Inflicts Mental damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Dealor&#39;s Luminary Ballad </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases parry and intelligence at a low power cost. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Dirge</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Discouraging Discante </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Reduces strength and agility on the target and surrounding encounter members within the area of effect. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Discouraging Discante </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Reduces strength and agility on the target an